<p>台語教材定定會看著佮疊詞相關的討論，像二疊詞佮三疊詞的程度精差、三疊詞的特殊變調，閣有 AABB ABAB 這種型式。
這篇教典僻智識共逐家介紹六條教典內底看起來足成疊詞煞毋是疊詞的詞彙，攏是仝款的漢字煞兩字三字愛讀無仝的讀音。初開始學台語文的時陣看著這款詞定定會唸毋著捎無意思呢。
教典僻智識系列真久無更新囉，最近閣有一寡有的無的通好分享，若是你閣知影啥物其他類似的假疊詞歡迎留話分享。</p>

文章語言：台語
        <figure><img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-cover.jpg"
    alt="仝款漢字無仝音義的詞"><figcaption>
      <p>封面四个例句，柑仔色的詞彙意思分別是啥？</p>
    </figcaption>
</figure>

<p>今仔日的教典僻智識又閣是較實用的內容囉，頂禮拜面友 
<a href="https://www.facebook.com/I.am.u.jim" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lim Iu-sing </a> 問講敢會當整理教典中像「交易 ka-ia̍h/kau-i̍k」這種唸無仝讀音意義就無仝的詞目，透過表格工具寫一寡函數就會當為教典文字資料篩選出來矣。
這其中包括頂禮拜已經介紹過的 8 組輕聲詞彙，攏總有 41 組像按呢的詞彙，遮共八組我個人較佮意的詞目整理做貼文分享予逐家。完整的列表囥佇留話區，歡迎閣再點入去看。
文尾閣再明品一下，各位若是欲共教典僻智識的內容提去做教材抑是提去趁錢攏真歡迎，《教典十誡》有講「做人愛有量，才會有福報。」喔!</p>
<div class="carousel-container">
  <div class="carousel-wrapper">
    <div class="carousel-track">
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-1.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-2.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-3.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-4.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-5.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-6.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-7.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian17-8.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="carousel-controls">
    <button class="carousel-btn prev">&#8592;</button>
    <div class="carousel-indicator">
      <span class="carousel-current">1</span>/<span class="carousel-total"
        >8</span
      >
    </div>
    <button class="carousel-btn next">&#8594;</button>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function () {
    const container = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
    const track = container.querySelector(".carousel-track");
    const images = track.querySelectorAll("img");
    const prevBtn = container.querySelector(".carousel-btn.prev");
    const nextBtn = container.querySelector(".carousel-btn.next");
    const indicator = container.querySelector(".carousel-indicator");
    const current = indicator.querySelector(".carousel-current");
    let idx = 0;
    function update() {
      track.style.transform = `translateX(-${idx * 100}%)`;
      current.textContent = idx + 1;
    }
    prevBtn.onclick = function () {
      idx = (idx - 1 + images.length) % images.length;
      update();
    };
    nextBtn.onclick = function () {
      idx = (idx + 1) % images.length;
      update();
    };

    let startX = null;
    track.addEventListener("touchstart", (e) => {
      startX = e.touches[0].clientX;
    });
    track.addEventListener("touchend", (e) => {
      if (startX === null) return;
      let dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - startX;
      if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) {
        if (dx < 0) nextBtn.onclick();
        else prevBtn.onclick();
      }
      startX = null;
    });
  })();
</script>

